		{"id":"05606db0cc01a4d2","type":"text","text":"Decipher the using the 'Numeric Core' calculation on each word to produce a letter","x":940,"y":1717,"width":660,"height":50},
		{"id":"83ae998ef5cbf15b","type":"text","text":"\n| S   | T   | I   | L   | L   |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| W   | A   | T   | E   | R   |\n| T   | I   | N   | T   | S   |\n| B   | L   | A   | N   | K   |\n| B   | O   | O   | K   | S   |\n","x":940,"y":1789,"width":340,"height":226},
