		{"id":"184bf0196af565e1","type":"text","text":"apply the algortihm:\n\n((((1000)/200)*11)-2) = 53\n\nsum the core:\n\n5 + 3 = 8 (vault 53 is opened by Key 8)","x":-16,"y":455,"width":407,"height":225},
